9 active factors <= 10 cap) with fallback to DEFAULT_ENSEMBLE:
  trend_r2_30_signed    w=0.1945 dir=+1  signed 30d log-price trend R2
  semi_down_ratio_20    w=0.1494 dir=-1  downside/upside semi-vol ratio - 1
